{"id":"vod_sn_38597","vodId":"38597","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"刺客守则","name_cn":"刺客守则","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/41ce91f6ca70d5e6f286e91f0dc521cf.jpg"},"summary":"梅莉达（楠木灯 配音）出生于大名鼎鼎的豪门“圣骑士”家族，每一位拥有圣骑士血统的亲眷们都能够使用非常强大的能力。可是，这样的能力在梅莉达的身上却全无踪迹，梅莉达因为被怀疑血统并不纯正而遭到了流放，可即便如此，勤劳坚韧的梅莉达还是对每日的修行毫不松懈，坚信自己总有一天能够爆发出令旁人震惊的力量。　　库法（小野友树 配音）被排遣到梅莉达的身边成为了她的家庭教师，实际上，库法的真实身份是隶属于白夜骑兵团的杀手。上级命令库法接近梅莉达，一旦确认她确实无法使用能力后，即将她暗杀。然而，梅莉达的乐观和坚持渐渐打动了库法。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7fWp06z8jg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mzhj9gDviZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qYXDdzunkN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SimhGci8SY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vZ4CdJmNb81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/pxufji3Wq81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sD4bRAp0st1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vv88ddC12t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y1aGZzp3eg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KeZ9mESFwr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e7kgvB5T6A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/amc2rKWbTc1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.094Z"}